      "statement": "Design decisions are recorded in docs/adr/*.md and take precedence over other written documentation — where a design doc still disagrees, the ADR wins — while the repository's root design docs are documents for the target system rather than a current file map, and the generated wiki is optional just-in-time context rather than required reading; wiki pages therefore cite an ADR by number instead of restating its decision.",
