      "id": "claim_889fdf95408c4afb8563d668e57e14b0",
      "statement": "A set of hand-authored documents is authoritative in its own right and is read as evidence rather than rewritten: docs/adr/** (the design decisions), docs/BACKEND.md (part of the authoritative current-implementation spec for the routing/AR/trust layers), docs/ADMIN.md (which cites ADR-0012 as the authoritative R2 scope), PRODUCT.md and DESIGN.md (product strategy/voice and the visual system, with DESIGN.md winning on visual decisions), docs/CONTEXT.md (the glossary), specs/** (specification artifacts), docs/CRITIQUE.md, docs/DEVIATIONS.md and docs/thesis/** (thesis process records), and the historical design docs docs/OVERVIEW.md, docs/TECHSTACK.md, docs/SCHEMA.md and docs/SUMMARY.md, whose line numbers the ADRs and docs/DEVIATIONS.md cite.",
