      "id": "claim_43b48e3f2f2441e093f8ae37fe69a161",
      "statement": "No graph builder, Dijkstra, navigation endpoint, ETA, GPS-trace pipeline, trust scoring or AR exists in the repository: the server registers only status and auth publicly plus one auth-guarded plugin at /api/admin holding the CRUD modules, export and the Mapbox proxy; packages/shared exports only domain types and Zod schemas whose interfaces carry distance and geometry fields but no duration or speed; and apps/mobile is an Expo starter whose dependencies include no camera, sensors, map or SQLite package.",
