    {
      "id": "claim_efcb446b5364434ca39336bdf9e8d2bb",
      "statement": "Running the system locally requires the Supabase CLI stack (supabase start, which applies supabase/migrations/ and supabase/seed.sql on first start), an apps/server/.env copied from .env.example with DATABASE_URL, SUPABASE_URL, SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY, ADMIN_EMAIL, ADMIN_PASSWORD and PORT, and pnpm install; the Fastify server then runs on http://localhost:3000 via pnpm --filter server dev, the admin SPA on the Vite dev origin http://localhost:5173 that the server's ADMIN_ORIGINS allowlist defaults to, and of the two test suites pnpm --filter admin test is hermetic with no database while pnpm --filter server test needs the local stack plus apps/server/.env.",
